@Demo.Outbox.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5105

### 创建订单（订单与 OrderCreated outbox 消息在同一内存事务写入，返回 201）
POST {{Demo.Outbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product": "键盘",
  "quantity": 2
}

### 查看订单列表
GET {{Demo.Outbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Accept: application/json

### 查看 outbox 消息状态（后台每秒轮询发布，约 1 秒后重查：Pending 变 Published）
GET {{Demo.Outbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/outbox
Accept: application/json

### 参数校验失败（quantity 必须大于 0，返回 400）
POST {{Demo.Outbox.Api_HostAddress}}/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "product": "键盘",
  "quantity": 0
}

###
GET {{Demo.Outbox.Api_HostAddress}}/health
Accept: application/json
